WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Emergence morphology: trace, threshold, decay, human-review gate, hybrid metabolism.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Land differentiates into habitat, metabolic, phenotypic, and fallow tissue.

00:09.000 --> 00:15.000
Landmarks are accretions; agents propose, humans confirm safety, heritage, privacy, demolition.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
A conceptual morphological experiment, not a zoning map or a proven law.
